\n\n$$\nV=|-22|=22.\n$$"] [17592186262909 "By the scalar function multiple rule, we have\n \n\n$$\n(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'}=u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t).$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\sqrt{t}),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\hspace{0.167em}2t,\\hspace{0.167em}1⟩ \\\\ {u}^{'}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\sqrt{t}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'} & =u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{t}⟨\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{t}},\\hspace{0.167em}2t,\\hspace{0.167em}1⟩+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}}⟨\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}{t}^{2},\\hspace{0.167em}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\hspace{0.167em}4t\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}2\\sqrt{t}⟩+⟨1,\\hspace{0.167em}t\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}\\sqrt{t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\hspace{0.167em}5t\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}3\\sqrt{t}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186262910 "By the scalar function multiple rule, we have\n\n$$\n(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'}=u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t).$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1+t),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\hspace{0.167em}1,\\hspace{0.167em}2t⟩ \\\\ {u}^{'}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-t) \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'} & =u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t) \\\\  & =(1-t)⟨1,\\hspace{0.167em}1,\\hspace{0.167em}2t⟩-⟨t,\\hspace{0.167em}1+t,\\hspace{0.167em}{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-t,\\hspace{0.167em}1-t,\\hspace{0.167em}2t-2{t}^{2}⟩-⟨t,\\hspace{0.167em}1+t,\\hspace{0.167em}{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-2t,\\hspace{0.167em}-2t,\\hspace{0.167em}2t-3{t}^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186262911 "By the scalar function multiple rule, we have\n \n\n$$\n(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'}=u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t).$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4\\sqrt{t}),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3}),\\hspace{0.167em}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+{t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{t}},\\hspace{0.167em}3{t}^{2},\\hspace{0.167em}1+2t⟩ \\\\ {u}^{'}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)\\mathbf{g}(t))^{'} & =u(t){\\mathbf{g}}^{'}(t)+{u}^{'}(t)\\mathbf{g}(t) \\\\  & =2t⟨\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{t}},\\hspace{0.167em}3{t}^{2},\\hspace{0.167em}1+2t⟩+2⟨4\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}{t}^{3},\\hspace{0.167em}t+{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}6{t}^{3},\\hspace{0.167em}2t+4{t}^{2}⟩+⟨8\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}2{t}^{3},\\hspace{0.167em}2t+2{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨12\\sqrt{t},\\hspace{0.167em}8{t}^{3},\\hspace{0.167em}4t+6{t}^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186262912 "First, we find the displacement vectors $\\overset{\\to }{AB},$ $\\overset{\\to }{AC},$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AD}$ that span the parallelepiped:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\mathbf{b}-\\mathbf{a} \\\\  & =(4\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+7\\mathbf{k})-(5\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+4\\mathbf{k}) \\\\  & =-\\mathbf{i}+3\\mathbf{k} \\\\  & =⟨-1,0,3⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =\\mathbf{c}-\\mathbf{a} \\\\  & =(3\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+5\\mathbf{k})-(5\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+4\\mathbf{k}) \\\\  & =-2\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{k} \\\\  & =⟨-2,0,1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AD} & =\\mathbf{d}-\\mathbf{a} \\\\  & =(2\\mathbf{i}+3\\mathbf{j}+3\\mathbf{k})-(5\\mathbf{i}+\\mathbf{j}+4\\mathbf{k}) \\\\  & =-3\\mathbf{i}+2\\mathbf{j}-\\mathbf{k} \\\\  & =⟨-3,2,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to find the volume o